From e2b50d54b2ba3fec6e80275d154629ffcbb3ba98 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mickael Bergeron <mickael.bergeron.pro@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 12:04:15 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Add RMScopies: Raaphorst-Moura-Stevens strength-3 CAs,
 extended by shifted column copies

- RMScopies(q, m): the RMS (2014) array CA(2q^3-1; 3, q^2+q+1, q) for prime q,
  extended by m shifted copies of existing columns plus layers of q^2 runs.
- RMScopiesCA(k, v) and N_RMScopiesCA(t, k, v) follow the package conventions.
- Run sizes: 2q^3-1 (m=0), 2q^3-1+q^2(q-2) (m=1),
  2q^3+q^2*max(q-2, ceiling(m(q-2)/q)) (m>=2).
- Improves 60 entries of the Colbourn tables (Nov 2024 status), e.g.
  CA(324;3,32,5) (was 349), CA(325;3,36,5) (349), CA(350;3,37,5) (365),
  CA(931;3,64,7) (1014), CA(3751;3,144,11) (3971), CA(6253;3,196,13) (6565).
- Tests in tests/testthat/test-RMScopies.R.

